e automatic update check\\n      --remote string            Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)\\n      --remote-board string      Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)\\n\\nUse \\\"task-board worktree transaction [command] --help\\\" for more information about a command.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3270,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 818,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
